  "marks": 1,
  "text": "A car accelerates uniformly from rest to $20\\text{ m s}^{-1}$ in $5.0\\text{ s}$. What is the acceleration?",
  "choices": [
    "$2.0\\text{ m s}^{-2}$",
    "$4.0\\text{ m s}^{-2}$",
    "$10\\text{ m s}^{-2}$",
    "$100\\text{ m s}^{-2}$"
  ],
  "solution": "B — $a = \\frac{v - u}{t} = \\frac{20 - 0}{5.0} = 4.0\\text{ m s}^{-2}$."
}
